ment when we began to believe that the entire world could be managed by data.","kw":["moment","when","began","believe","entire","world","could","managed"],"ch":4},{"t":39.26,"dur":6,"clip":"05_damocles/Test_subject_beneath_mechanical_arm_202607101926.mp4","file":"assets/05_damocles/Test_subject_beneath_mechanical_arm_202607101926.mp4","in":3.88,"text":"They wanted to map the human mind, to connect the brain directly to a digital world.","kw":["wanted","human","mind","connect","brain","directly","digital","world"],"ch":5},{"t":48.25,"dur":7,"clip":"06_public-grid/Computer_terminals_in_municipal_…_202607101928.mp4","file":"assets/06_public-grid/Computer_terminals_in_municipal_…_202607101928.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1972, a new experiment began to connect ordinary people to a vast network of data.","kw":["experiment","began","connect","ordinary","people","vast","network","data"],"ch":6},{"t":57.24,"dur":4,"clip":"07_nasa-view/Military_simulation_room_calibra…_202607101936.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/Military_simulation_room_calibra…_202607101936.mp4","in":5.88,"text":"They were simply waiting to be told what to do by cold data.","kw":["simply","waiting","told","what","cold","data"],"ch":7},{"t":66.23,"dur":7,"clip":"08_vpl/People_wearing_HMDs_DataGloves_202607101938.mp4","file":"assets/08_vpl/People_wearing_HMDs_DataGloves_202607101938.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1987, scientists believed they could create a new world, a shared space beyond physical reality.","kw":["scientists","believed","could","create","world","shared","space","beyond"],"ch":8},{"t":75.22,"dur":7.28,"clip":"09_arcade-era/AI_historical_reconstruction_VHS…_202607101900.mp4","file":"assets/09_arcade-era/AI_historical_reconstruction_VHS…_202607101900.mp4","in":0,"text":"They promised they escaped from reality, but they were trapped in a private world.","kw":["promised","escaped","reality","trapped","private","world"],"ch":9},{"t":84.89,"dur":6,"clip":"10_vr-winter/AI_historical_reconstruction_1995_202607101901.mp4","file":"assets/10_vr-winter/AI_historical_reconstruction_1995_202607101901.mp4","in":2.88,"text":"In reality, we were moving into a world where everyone would be perfectly isolated.","kw":["reality","moving","world","where","everyone","would","perfectly","isolated"],"ch":10},{"t":93.25,"dur":5.6,"clip":"11_oculus/VR_prototype_headset_duct_tape_202607101941.mp4","file":"assets/11_oculus/VR_prototype_headset_duct_tape_202607101941.mp4","in":4.12,"text":"A way to escape into a world where reality itself was perfectly controlled.","kw":["escape","world","where","reality","itself","perfectly","controlled"],"ch":11},{"t":102.18,"dur":7.68,"clip":"12_consumer-vr/Person_wearing_VR_headset_hits_202607101942.mp4","file":"assets/12_consumer-vr/Person_wearing_VR_headset_hits_202607101942.mp4","in":0,"text":"But this was a fantasy where the real world would soon intervene.","kw":["fantasy","where","real","world","would","soon","intervene"],"ch":12},{"t":111.17,"dur":7,"clip":"13_open-standard/Hands_passing_VR_trackers_202607101943.mp4","file":"assets/13_open-standard/Hands_passing_VR_trackers_202607101943.mp4","in":2.88,"text":"A retreat from the giant systems into a world they could build together.","kw":["retreat","giant","systems","world","could","build","together"],"ch":13},{"t":120.16,"dur":8,"clip":"14_vision-pro/Spatial_interface_demonstration_…_202607101944.mp4","file":"assets/14_vision-pro/Spatial_interface_demonstration_…_202607101944.mp4","in":0,"text":"This is the simplified world, where everything is tracked and perfectly connected.","kw":["simplified","world","where","everything","tracked","perfectly","connected"],"ch":14}],"duck":[[0,3.15,0.55],[3.62,8.87,0.28],[8.99,12.14,0.55],[12.29,17.3,0.28],[17.98,21.13,0.55],[21.28,28.13,0.28],[26.97,30.12,0.55],[30.27,36.52,0.28],[35.96,39.11,0.55],[39.26,45.51,0.28],[44.95,48.1,0.55],[48.25,55.5,0.28],[53.94,57.09,0.55],[57.24,61.49,0.28],[62.93,66.08,0.55],[66.23,73.48,0.28],[71.92,75.07,0.55],[75.22,82.75,0.2